      "settings": {
        "title": "Why Choose Bolsius Candles?",
        "class": "",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "<p>Bolsius candles are the result of over 150 years of candle-making expertise. Founded in 1870 in the Netherlands, Bolsius has become a leader in the candle industry, blending tradition with innovation. What makes Bolsius special? Their commitment to quality, sustainability, and craftsmanship. Kisco is pleased to be a leading provider of Bolsius candles in the colors and styles that are popular with individuals and businesses alike.</p><p>Here are a few of the many reasons to choose Bolsius candles:</p><ul><li><strong>Clean Burn:</strong> Bolsius candles are made using a unique blend of natural, plant-based waxes that are free from palm oil and harmful additives. This ensures a clean and long-lasting burn with no dripping or smoking for a healthier home environment.</li><li><strong>Environmental Impact:</strong> Bolsius is a <a href=\"https://www.bcorporation.net/en-us/certification/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Certified B Corporation</span></a>. From their eco-friendly packaging to their goal to lower carbon emissions throughout the production process, Bolsius is committed to reducing their environmental footprint. </li><li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Because Bolsius unscented candles burn cleanly, they're a welcome addition to many settings, including homes, offices, businesses, restaurants, and event venues. </li></ul>",
        "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base",
