        },
        "text_EKxTAp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Below, we've addressed some common questions about Bolsius candles. Please <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> for more information.  </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "subheading_p8gj6J": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Where are Bolsius candles made?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_Ye8Uwz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Bolsius candles are proudly crafted in the Netherlands, where the company has been perfecting the art of candle-making for over a century.</strong> Their heritage of craftsmanship and innovation ensures that every candle is made with care, blending tradition with modern, sustainable practices.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "subheading_FBVdhU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Where can I buy Bolsius Candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_NkxQTm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>You can buy Bolsius candles directly through our website. </strong>We offer a variety of options for individual purchases, as well as Bolsius candles wholesale for those looking to buy in bulk — perfect for businesses, event planners, or anyone who loves having quality candles on hand.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "subheading_XLGUVt": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are Bolsius Candles made with sustainable materials?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_ywRjD9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Yes! Bolsius is deeply committed to sustainability. Their candles are made using natural, plant-based waxes that are free from palm oil and harsh chemicals. </strong>Additionally, the packaging is made from recycled materials, and their production process is designed to minimize environmental impact. When you choose Bolsius candles, you get a high-quality product and support a brand dedicated to protecting the environment.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
